4. Audio / 音频
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
No audio files are shipped in this repository: as of 2026-10-21 there are
zero `.ogg`, `.wav` or `.mp3` files under `mod/`. Sound effects and music are
played from the player's own game installation at runtime.
本仓库不包含音频文件；音效与音乐在运行时由玩家本体的游戏提供。

5. Third-party libraries / 第三方库
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The mod depends on BaseLib (https://github.com/Alchyr/BaseLib-StS2), which is
MIT-licensed and is NOT bundled here. Build-time packages (Krafs.Publicizer,
Alchyr.Sts2.ModAnalyzers, BSchneppe.StS2.PckPacker, Godot.NET.Sdk) keep their
own licenses and are restored from NuGet.

