7. Removal policy / 移除政策
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
If you are a rights holder and want an asset removed, open an issue at
https://github.com/Twelve-eight/sts2-spire1/issues. We will remove it and,
where technically possible, replace the shipped copy with a runtime reference
to the player's own game installation.
如权利方要求移除某素材，请开 issue；我们会删除，并在技术上可行时改为
运行时引用玩家本体的游戏资源。

